.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# ─── Generated / temp ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
*.tmp

# ─── Corrected / additional ignores ────────────────────────────────────────────
# The NDK external-build dir actually lives at android/app/.cxx (the rule above
# used the wrong path and never matched). It contains fetched GLM + GTest sources.
android/app/.cxx/
**/build/
*.apk
*.aab

# ─── Manufacturer CLF corpus (430 MB) ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Third-party manufacturer measurement data. Not tracked, and deliberately NOT
# under assets/ - anything in assets/ is packaged into the APK, and bundling
# this put the debug build at 317 MB against Play's 150 MB base limit. It is
# also someone else's data to redistribute, which is not ours to do.
# Kept locally at corpus/clf/ as a development and test fixture only.
# The checksummed index (inventory.json) and sources.json ARE tracked, so a
# corpus can be restored and verified file by file.
corpus/
android/app/src/main/assets/clf/raw/
